imud (1.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Sea state: significant wave height, wave period, roll/pitch periods and
    significant amplitudes from the heave/attitude oscillations ([fusion]
    wave_tau_s, WAVE_VALID flag). Compass-health diagnostics (mag_anomaly,
    mag_residual) computed in the filter. ENGINE_ON flag exports the
    engine-vibration detector.
  * Binary stream packet v14 (260 bytes; fields appended before the CRC).
    Wire-pinned consumers must be rebuilt together with the daemon; libimud
    applications are unaffected.
  * imud_client.h is deprecated (use libimud) and no longer installed.
  * Fix the CI verification steps added in 1.3 (hardening-check fortify
    false positive on libimud.so; versioned-symbol handling in the ABI
    surface check); CI now also covers arm64 and ASan/UBSan.

